# Environment Variables Template
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development

# ============================================
# CURRENTLY NO ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES REQUIRED
# ============================================

# If you add API keys or secrets in the future, add them here:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_KEY=your_public_api_key_here
# API_SECRET=your_secret_api_key_here

# Note: 
# - NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables are exposed to the browser
# - Other variables are only available server-side
